  "description": {
    "ja": {
      "source": "Wikipedia 日本語版「チシャノキ (ムラサキ科)」",
      "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%81%E3%82%B7%E3%83%A3%E3%83%8E%E3%82%AD_(%E3%83%A0%E3%83%A9%E3%82%B5%E3%82%AD%E7%A7%91)",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 110834641,
      "text": "チシャノキ（萵苣木）は、ムラサキ目ムラサキ科チシャノキ属の落葉高木。日本の植物分類資料では、一般に Ehretia acuminata R.Br. var. obovata (Lindl.) I.M.Johnst. をチシャノキの標準学名として扱う。一方、キュー王立植物園の Plants of the World Online (POWO) や Flora of China などでは var. obovata を独立した変種として認めず、熱帯・亜熱帯アジアからオーストラリア東部まで広く分布する広義の Ehretia acuminata R.Br. に含める。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia 英語版「Ehretia acuminata」",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ehretia_acuminata",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 1359235491,
      "text": "Ehretia acuminata is a deciduous tree native to regions from India to Japan and south to eastern Australia. It was first described in 1810 and has the conservation status of least concern. In Australia it is commonly known as koda."
    }
  },
